swimlane-beta LR
  subgraph intake [Evidence intake]
    request([Receive source])
    retain[Retain exact original evidence]
  end

  subgraph review [Independent review]
    inspect[Inspect complete record]
    compare{Does rendered output match the source?}
    correct[Correct the recoverable mismatch]
  end

  subgraph report [Report and archive]
    publish[Publish findings with evidence references]
    archive[Archive verified source and rendered result]
    done((Review complete))
  end

  request --> retain
  retain -->|Stable evidence reference| inspect
  inspect --> compare
  compare -->|Yes| publish
  compare -->|No| correct
  correct -->|Re-run deterministic validation| inspect
  publish --> archive
  publish -.->|Notify reader| done
  archive --> done
